WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:06.760
 Next week, the adventures of Ozzy and Harriet will be brought to you by the Coca-Cola Company.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.980
 Like a good many other American husbands, Ozzy is a valiant do-it-yourselfer.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:18.240
 And with Grandma Nelson's old cuckoo clock that hasn't run in 30 years, he's got a king-size problem.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.200
 But here comes Harriet with a king-size answer, king-size Coca-Cola.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:34.440
 Yes, whenever you need real refreshment, you want ice-cold, sparkling Coca-Cola with the cold, crisp taste, the lively, refreshing new feeling that only Coke can give.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:39.640
 And when you want more of the world's best refreshment, you want king-size Coca-Cola.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.080
 After you pour, still lots more, a second glass for you.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:49.720
 Yes, your family's biggest king-size refreshment value is king-size Coke.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:59.440
 Yeah, when you want to be really refreshed, have an ice-cold Coca-Cola.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:00.820
 Make it king-size.

